## Control {{controlId}}: Establish an Operational Incident-Handling Capability

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

This organization establishes operational incident-handling capability within the {{tenantName}} M365 GCC High tenant through Microsoft Defender incident management, documented procedures, and response testing managed by {{variables.systemAdministrator}}.

{{#if securityAlertsActive}}
**Incident Detection:**
{{securityAlertsCount}} security alerts provide automated incident detection:
{{#if alerts}}
{{#each alerts}}
- **{{title}}** — Severity: {{severity}} — Status: {{status}} — {{createdDateTime}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

Microsoft Defender automatically correlates related alerts into incidents, providing unified investigation views with affected entities, evidence, and recommended actions.
{{else}}
Automated incident detection has not been confirmed through security alert configuration.
{{/if}}

**Incident Response Phases:**
- **Preparation:** Incident response plan documented, roles assigned, communication channels established, playbooks maintained
- **Detection & Analysis:** Microsoft Defender alerts trigger investigation; severity assessed per organizational criteria
- **Containment:** Compromised accounts disabled, affected devices isolated, malicious content quarantined
- **Eradication:** Root cause identified and eliminated; malware removed, vulnerabilities patched
- **Recovery:** Systems restored to normal operations; monitoring enhanced for recurrence
- **Post-Incident:** After-action review, lessons learned documented, plan updated

{{#if attackSimulationsActive}}
**Incident Preparedness:**
{{attackSimulationsCount}} attack simulations validate user readiness and incident reporting procedures.
{{/if}}

**Responsible Party:** {{variables.systemAdministrator}}

**Verification Method:** Examine incident response plan, Defender incident records, containment action logs, and after-action review documentation.

{{#if evidenceArtifacts}}
**Evidence:**
{{#each evidenceArtifacts}}
- {{label}}
{{/each}}
{{else}}
**Evidence:** {{evidenceArtifactUrl}}
{{/if}}
